    "type": "question",
    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "Slips of paper numbered $1, 2, 3, \\ldots, 10$ are placed in a hat and one is drawn at random. What is the probability that the number on the slip of paper is not a multiple of three?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{7}{10}$",
      "worked": "The favourable outcomes are $1,2,4,5,7,8,10$.\n\n$$P(\\text{not a multiple of three})=\\frac{7}{10}.$$",
